      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LAKODA BONNIE (7) is yet to miss the placings in an excellent record this track and trip which boasts two wins and three placings. Recorded a 2 length win (25.66) in a Grade 5 last time at Q Lakeside. Has the ability and should feature. ARCANE (6) has been in the money at her last two runs, most recently when second (25.81) in a Grade 5 over 457m at Q Lakeside. This looks easier and expected to improve sharply. TIP TOE FLOW (3) boasts a strong record this journey here with six wins and nine minors from 16 tries. Placed last time (19.88) at this track in a Grade 5, finishing third and beaten 2.5 lengths. Looks suited here and can measure up. JADE CLOVER (8) will have admirers again after placing from the same draw last time out.",
